# Pre-interview requirements flow (implemented)

## Intended behavior

When **both** `requiresScreening` and `requiresTest` are false, all applicants become interview-eligible after the application deadline (or immediately on apply as `INTERVIEW_ELIGIBLE`).

## Implementation

- `buildInterviewEligibleApplicationWhere()` + `getInitialScreeningStatusForJob()` in `applicationTrackerState.js`
- `interviewScheduling.js` uses job-aware eligibility everywhere; `backfillNoGateInterviewEligibility()` promotes legacy `APPLIED` rows on session open
- Tracker shows resume/QA as **Not Required** when flags are off
- `Boolean(job.requiresScreening)` used consistently (not `!== false`)

## Legacy interview API

`/api/admin/interview/*` returns **410 Gone**. Use `/api/admin/interview-scheduling` only.
